OL,3,ALib Dem MP quits frontbench job over Ed
OL,4,ADavey's leadership
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat MP Charlie Maynard has
OL,7,Fresigned from the party's frontbench
OL,8,Fand wants to see Sir Ed Davey replaced
OL,9,Fas leader.
OL,11,FAs first reported by the Financial
OL,12,FTimes, the Witney MP left his role as
OL,13,FTreasury spokesman on Friday.
OL,15,FThose close to Sir Ed privately
OL,16,Facknowledge that there is what they see
OL,17,Fas a "small group" of Liberal Democrat
OL,18,FMPs who are not happy with his
OL,19,Fleadership, of which Maynard is one.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
