OL,3,ALib Dem MP quits frontbench job over Ed
OL,4,ADavey's leadership
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaisy Cooper, the deputy leader of the
OL,7,Fparty, said: "The vast majority of our
OL,8,FMPs support Ed, want him to lead the
OL,9,Fparty into the next election, and are
OL,10,Ffurious at this distraction." The BBC
OL,11,Fhas approached Maynard for comment.
